<title>LEBANON: Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth eight bln pounds.</title>
<headline>Bank of Lebanon issues CDs worth eight bln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lebanon issued on Thursday certificates of deposit dated January 17 to commercial banks worth eight billion Lebanese pounds.</p>
<p>All the CDs sold were 60-day certificates at 13 percent annual interest. There were no sales of 45-day CDs at 12.25 percent.</p>
<p>Last week the Bank sold 45-day CDs worth one billion pounds at 12.25 percent and made no sales of 60-day CDs.</p>
<p>Beirut editorial (9611) 602057 345740</p>
